<p>&quot;How are you doing today?&quot; Pretty hard to spin that into something fatal, except maybe through &quot;today&quot; aging you to death or time-looping you. But that's kind of silly.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Test log for Dr. ███████, 2/31/████<br />
Test Subjects:D-555/1220<br />
Native Language: English, American derivation<br />
Word Spoken: &quot;How are you doing today(inquisitive conjugation)&quot; [See attached list for included morphemes<br />
